ine-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001855A320"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001855D940">In recognition of your partnership with Qantas, and as a valued Level 3 Qantas Business Rewards member, I would like to&nbsp;<strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001855DB80">schedule a call</strong>&nbsp;with you as your dedicated Account Representative. In this call, I will answer any questions you may have about the program and discuss ways your business can unlock more rewards, bigger savings, and greater value.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001855DF10"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001855E020">If you are interested in this, please reply with confirmation of your availability for a call and I will be in contact with you.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001855E260"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001855E370">In the meantime, your benefits as a Level 3 member are available via our&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/home.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001855E5B0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">website</a>&nbsp;or when you log into your&nbsp;<a href="https://accounts.qantas.com/qbr/identity/login?oauth-type=qbr" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001855E940" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">account</a>.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001855ECD0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001855EDE0">For assistance with your account, please call our Service Centre on 13 74 78 between 7am-7pm AEST, Monday to Friday.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001855F020"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001855F130">{!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001855F810">{!User.Title}<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001855FA50"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001855FB60">Qantas Business Rewards<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001855FDA0"><em data_liveedit_tagid="000000001855FFE0">Qantas Airways Limited</em><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018560240"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018560480">A Wing, Level 4, 10 Bourke Road, Mascot NSW 2020<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000185606C0">P. <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">XXX</span><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018560900">E. {!User.Email}</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018560DA0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018561000" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000185614C0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018561720" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018562B10"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018562D70" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018562FD0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018563230"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018563490"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000185636F0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018563950" style="font-size: 10px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017E2C280"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017E2C4E0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017E2C740" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000017E2CC00"><td align="center" valign="top" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="0000